From 0e668b9c626d1d9315ae847414fde7916ee8c14d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 02:28:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 
 0022-options-list-scroll-overrides-per-look-smaa-search-menu-runs-rain

The game's Options list: every PC setting as rows of its own (spinners for settings with more than two values), the live
recomp.ini options, eleven rows at a time with scrolling and scroll arrows; the page's fixed bars at their real address
(0x73D3D0). Texture overrides with several pictures for one texture take the first of the look in force (the Japanese
pictures under jp/ while that look is on), each decoded once. SMAA's search table read with point filtering, as the
reference does. keys.ini menu_game_runs (on by default): the game goes on behind the F1 menu. Rain on the lens: one
on/off setting (rain_on_lens, on by default), its strength from the map's rain, eased, with gusts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
